# a page change redraws the WHOLE screen: HOME HOME HOME in a quick row left the garden over the TRACKS rows (a band a frame)
wait 600
tap HOME
wait 40
tap HOME
wait 40
tap HOME
wait 40
snap 0
wait 500
snap 1
expect page 11
expect_snap
# and back to the garden (it moves: the header and the foot are compared), then through a hold
tap HOME
wait 40
snap 0
wait 500
snap 1
expect_snap 0 28
expect_snap 172 240
tap HOME
wait 30
press HOME
wait 700
release HOME
wait 150
snap 0
wait 500
snap 1
expect_snap
